SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Replace entirely with 30–40 min Z1 spin
  at 100–127W (below Z
DESCRIPTION:Replace entirely with 30–40 min Z1 spin at 100–127W (below 
 Z2 floor) if body battery ≥45\, or full rest if <45 — do not attempt 2
 10–244W (Z4) this week under any circumstances given the sleep deficit.\
 n\nReason: 210–244W is high Z3/Z4 intensity which cannot be safely absor
 bed after multiple consecutive nights of sub-5h sleep and body battery rea
 dings in the teens and twenties\; Z1 reactivation is the appropriate stimu
 lus.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
END:VEVENT
