SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] swimming — Build to 3000m total: 400m warm-up\, 10 
 × 200m @ 2:25/100m wi
DESCRIPTION:Build to 3000m total: 400m warm-up\, 10 × 200m @ 2:25/100m wit
 h 20-sec rest\, 200m cool-down — this is the first session targeting Hal
 f Oceanman 5000m race volume and should feel comfortably hard\, not maxima
 l.\n\nReason: Half Oceanman is 63 days away requiring 5000m continuous swi
 m\; current pool sessions cap at 2000m and need progressive volume increas
 es starting in Wk9 to build confidence and endurance for race distance.\n\
 nAI coaching 2026-08-01
END:VEVENT
