SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] swimming — Build to 3500m total: 400m warm-up\, 3 
 × 1000m @ 2:25–2:30/10
DESCRIPTION:Build to 3500m total: 400m warm-up\, 3 × 1000m @ 2:25–2:30/1
 00m with 60-sec rest between sets\, 100m cool-down — simulates broken ra
 ce distance and confirms aerobic pacing before the final build into race w
 eek.\n\nReason: Progressive swim volume needs to reach 3500–4000m in tra
 ining by Wk10 to give confidence and specificity for the 5000m Half Oceanm
 an race distance 33 days later.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
